Fix #242315

 ### Add your comment

Rewrite ad flags in inline state scripts with one `trusted-replace-node-text rule` (match: `/App(State|BootstrapData) = /`).

Remove redundant rules:
- `set-constant`: `features.ads`, `pencilAd`, `adshieldAdblockRecovery`
- `set-constant`: `AppBootstrapData.config.adshieldAdblockRecovery`
- `$replace` for `adshield*Recovery` (not supported in MV3)

